# <%= current_page.data.title %>

You should use the cluster that corresponds to your business unit and whether you are using the namespace for production or non-production workloads.

| Cluster | Business Unit | Hostname | Usage |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| container-platform-octo-nonlive | OCTO | octo-nonlive.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk| Non production workloads |
| container-platform-octo-live | OCTO | octo-live.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Production workloads |
| container-platform-hmpps-nonlive | HMPPS | hmpps-nonlive.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Non production workloads |
| container-platform-hmpps-live | HMPPS | hmpps-live.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Production workloads |
| container-platform-laa-nonlive | LAA | laa-nonlive.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Non production workloads |
| container-platform-laa-live | LAA | laa-live.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Production workloads |
| container-platform-cd-nonlive | CD | cd-nonlive.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Non production workloads |
| container-platform-cd-live | CD | cd-live.container-platform.service.justice.gov.uk | Production workloads |

